{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1213527-anime-esque-consensual-reality","id":1213527,"title":"Anime Esque consensual reality?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-30T14:07:30-07:00","id":1213527,"title":"Anime Esque consensual reality?","content":"So.. i might end up running mage to a couple of hardcore otakus. thing is my group and i talked and we decided to make consensus a bit more Lite but still having some heavy paradox rules. to up the antics on Magic Realism and even some more ghibli esque elements.<br /> <br /> i could use some suggestions or ideas. <br /> also, they are heavy into boku no hero (i havent watched it) but im taking a more of a &quot;Lain&quot;/&quot;Ghibli&quot;/&quot;Monster/&quot;Killer 7&quot; approach, any advices ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T16:08:34-07:00","id":1213563,"title":"","content":"My advice is don\u2019t skimp on the paradigm. Whether they want to make magical girl mages, shinigami communers, dragon ball style martial artists, mech warriors, or even just some kids with weird psyonics, make sure they understand how their character thinks ma